                <pb facs="0306" n="204" sameAs="frus:frus1919v01/pg204"/>

                <note rend="inline" type="source">832.73/191: Telegram</note>
                <head><hi rendition="#italic">The Chargé in Brazil</hi> (<hi
                            rendition="#italic">Wadsworth</hi>) <hi rendition="#italic"
                        >to the Secretary of State</hi></head>
                <opener><dateline rendition="#float-right"><placeName><hi rendition="#small-caps"
                                >Rio de Janeiro</hi></placeName>, <date calendar="gregorian"
                            when="1919-12-16T13:00:00-03:00"><hi rendition="#italic">December 16,
                                1919, 1 p.m.</hi></date><lb/>[<hi rendition="#italic">Received 7.35
                            p.m.</hi>]</dateline></opener>
                <p>Embassy’s October 25th noon. Concession to Central and South American Cable
                    Company to lay cable from Rio de Janeiro to Cuba registered yesterday by
                    Tribunal de Contas.</p>
                <closer><signed><hi rendition="#small-caps">Wadsworth</hi></signed></closer>
            </div>
        </body>
